window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-48de7f90f27343f8"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"chatgpt-usage-limits-and-spend-controls\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"chatgpt\">ChatGPT 使用限额与支出控制</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>ChatGPT 工作区的使用限额和支出控制适用于工作区套餐下符合条件的活动，其中可能包括部分 Codex 活动。它们不能覆盖全部 Codex 用量，也不管理 OpenAI API Platform 账单。</p> <p>如需了解完整的管理模型，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">角色与工作区权限</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"know-when-these-controls-apply\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">了解这些控制何时适用</h2> <p>在以下情况下，请查看 ChatGPT 工作区的使用控制：</p> <ul> <li>组织所使用的协议包含共享或购买的 ChatGPT 工作区额度。</li> <li>符合条件的 Codex 活动可能会消耗这些额度。</li> <li>管理员需要设置用户使用边界、工作区级支出控制，或当前套餐支持的使用通知。</li> </ul> <p>使用控制不会配置功能使用资格或权限；不过，限额耗尽后，符合条件的功能可能会暂停使用。它们不会影响源系统权限，也不会管理 Platform API 的使用或账单。</p> <p><a id=\"ultrafast-mode\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">超高速模式</h2> <p>符合条件的 Enterprise 工作区默认关闭 GPT-6 Astra 超高速模式。工作区所有者可以通过<a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">角色和工作区权限</a>启用此模式。符合条件的超高速模式用量仍适用现有的个人支出限额。由于超高速模式的用量速率较高，启用前请检查这些限额，以免更快耗尽用户预算。</p> <p>套餐资格和计费详情请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">超高速模式</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"use-current-procedures\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">使用当前操作说明</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 ChatGPT Enterprise 和 Edu 中管理使用限额与超额用量（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001155-managing-credits-and-spend-controls-in-chatgpt-business\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 ChatGPT Business 中管理额度与支出控制（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"related-docs\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">相关文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ba100f6664b7be87\">ChatGPT Work：使用情况与成本</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-811aa7aeaf6b8cd4\">管理员推出指南</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-05f8d80ccc7b0b64\">治理</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e8a44d8693c261b7\">工作区分析</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">Codex 定价</a></li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"chatgpt-usage-limits-and-spend-controls\">ChatGPT usage limits and spend controls</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>ChatGPT workspace usage limits and spend controls apply to eligible activity under your workspace plan, which can include some Codex activity. They don't cover all Codex usage or govern OpenAI API Platform billing.</p> <p>For the complete administration model, see <a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">Roles and workspace permissions</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"know-when-these-controls-apply\">Know when these controls apply</h2> <p>Review ChatGPT workspace usage controls when:</p> <ul> <li>The organization's agreement uses shared or purchased ChatGPT workspace credits.</li> <li>Eligible Codex activity can consume those credits.</li> <li>Administrators need user guardrails, workspace-level spend controls, or usage notifications supported by the current plan.</li> </ul> <p>Usage controls don't configure feature entitlement or permissions, although exhausted limits can pause access to eligible features. They don't affect source-system permissions or govern Platform API usage or billing.</p> <h2 id=\"ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast mode</h2> <p>GPT-6 Astra Ultrafast is off by default in eligible Enterprise workspaces. Workspace owners can enable it through <a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">workspace permissions</a>. Existing per-user spend limits apply to eligible Ultrafast usage. Review those limits before enabling access because the higher usage rates can consume a user's budget faster.</p> <p>See <a href=\"#/article/a-55cdea3737e39583?anchor=ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast mode</a> for plan eligibility and billing details.</p> <h2 id=\"use-current-procedures\">Use current procedures</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Manage usage limits and overages in ChatGPT Enterprise and Edu (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001155-managing-credits-and-spend-controls-in-chatgpt-business\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Manage credits and spend controls in ChatGPT Business (online)</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"related-docs\">Related docs</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ba100f6664b7be87\">ChatGPT Work: usage and cost</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-811aa7aeaf6b8cd4\">Admin rollout guide</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-05f8d80ccc7b0b64\">Governance</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e8a44d8693c261b7\">Workspace analytics</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">Codex pricing</a></li> </ul>"};
